| Z2 check residual miss on `macro_expand(` / `ast_macro(` | **0** |
| Z3 import-concat SECRET hide | **0** |
| Z4 `${}` / decoy / CPP hide of unquoted IDENT | **0** |
| Alias residual-deny gap (no LPAREN) | **yes** (not expand) |
| emit-llvm/bc residual-deny | **not wired** (CALL symbol; no splice) |
| 2.10 wrapper FN (IMP3) | **yes** (not 2.8) |
| T1/T2/5.8/7.x reopened | **no** |
| CRIT SECRET hidden by expansion | **0** |

**2.8 security path-A: PASS** (no expand hole; second pass unneeded).

